{"1395":["<h4 style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-size:1.75em;font-weight:700\">DIRECT &amp; INVERSE PROPORTION — 1. THE IDEA</h4><h4 style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-size:1.75em;font-weight:700\">IN PICTURES</h4><p style=\"color:#d32f2f;font-weight:700\">NUMERATOR → DIRECT · DENOMINATOR → INVERSE · POWER → HOW FAST</p><div class=\"rb\" style=\"background:#f4f8fc;border-color:#1565c0\"><div class=\"rb dk nb\" style=\"background:#1565c0\"><p style=\"color:#fff;background:#1565c0;padding:0 .3em;border-radius:4px;font-size:1.11em;font-weight:700;background:#1565c0;padding:.25em .5em;border-radius:5px\">The five shapes of proportion</p></div><div class=\"rstrip\"><i data-k=\"0\"></i><i data-k=\"1\"></i><i data-k=\"2\"></i><i data-k=\"3\"></i><i data-k=\"4\"></i></div></div><div class=\"rb\" style=\"background:#f6f9f6;border-color:#2e7d32\"><div class=\"rb dk nb\" style=\"background:#2e7d32\"><p style=\"color:#fff;background:#2e7d32;padding:0 .3em;border-radius:4px;font-size:1.11em;font-weight:700;background:#2e7d32;padding:.25em .5em;border-radius:5px\">How to read any formula</p></div><p><b>Directly proportional (y ∝ x):</b> when x goes up, y goes up by the <b>same factor</b>. The ratio y/x stays constant. Example: I ∝ V for a fixed resistor.</p><p><b>Inversely proportional (y ∝ 1/x):</b> when x goes up, y goes down by the same factor. The product xy stays constant. Example: I ∝ 1/R for a fixed voltage.</p><p><b>Read a formula in 5 seconds:</b> anything in the <b>numerator</b> → direct; anything in the <b>denominator</b> → inverse. A <b>square</b> on top → ×4 when doubled; a square below → ÷4. A square root → ×√2 when doubled.</p><p><b>Exam trick:</b> write new/old = (factor)^power for each variable and multiply. E.g. P = V²/R with V × 2 and R × 2 → P × (2² / 2) = × 2.</p></div><div class=\"rb\" style=\"background:#fcf5f5;border-color:#c62828\"><div class=\"rb dk nb\" style=\"background:#c62828\"><p style=\"color:#fff;background:#c62828;padding:0 .3em;border-radius:4px;font-size:1.11em;font-weight:700;background:#c62828;padding:.25em .5em;border-radius:5px\">Change table — x changes, what happens to y?</p></div><div class=\"rtw\"><table class=\"rt\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background:#1a3a8f\">Relation</th><th style=\"background:#1a3a8f\">x changes</th><th style=\"background:#1a3a8f\">x changes</th><th style=\"background:#1a3a8f\">x changes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">y ∝ x</td><td>×2 → ×2</td><td>×3 → ×3</td><td>÷2 → ÷2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">y ∝ 1/x</td><td>×2 → ÷2</td><td>×3 → ÷3</td><td>÷2 → ×2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">y ∝ x²</td><td>×2 → ×4</td><td>×3 → ×9</td><td>÷2 → ÷4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">y ∝ 1/x²</td><td>×2 → ÷4</td><td>×3 → ÷9</td><td>÷2 → ×4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">y ∝ √x</td><td>×4 → ×2</td><td>×9 → ×3</td><td>÷4 → ÷2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">y ∝ 1/√x</td><td>×4 → ÷2</td><td>×9 → ÷3</td><td>÷4 → ×2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">y ∝ x³</td><td>×2 → ×8</td><td>×3 → ×27</td><td>÷2 → ÷8</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>",[["img/refp/proportion-0.webp",281,1325,0,281,255,155],["img/refp/proportion-0.webp",281,1325,261,262,255,144],["img/refp/proportion-0.webp",281,1325,522,262,255,144],["img/refp/proportion-0.webp",281,1325,783,262,281,144],["img/refp/proportion-0.webp",281,1325,1070,277,255,152]]],"1396":["<h4 style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-size:1.75em;font-weight:700\">DIRECT &amp; INVERSE PROPORTION — 2. CIRCUITS &amp; RESISTANCE · CAPACITORS, INDUCTORS &amp; AC</h4><p style=\"color:#d32f2f;font-size:1.15em;font-weight:700\">GREEN = GOES UP WITH · RED = GOES DOWN WITH · LAST COLUMN = READY ANSWER</p><div class=\"rb\" style=\"background:#f4f8fc;border-color:#1565c0\"><div class=\"rb dk nb\" style=\"background:#1565c0\"><p style=\"color:#fff;background:#1565c0;padding:0 .3em;border-radius:4px;font-size:1.19em;font-weight:700;background:#1565c0;padding:.25em .5em;border-radius:5px\">Circuits &amp; resistance</p></div><p style=\"color:#fff;background:#1b2a4a;padding:0 .3em;border-radius:4px;font-weight:700;background:#1b2a4a;padding:.25em .5em;border-radius:5px\">falls with (∝</p><div class=\"rtw\"><table class=\"rt rc\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">Quantity</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">Formula</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">rises with (∝) 1/)</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">if this changes → result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Current I</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">I = V/R</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">V R</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">V × 2 → I × 2 · R × 2 → I ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Resistance R</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">R = ρL/A</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">ρ, length L area A</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">L × 2 → R × 2 · A × 2 → R ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">R vs wire diameter</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">R = 4ρL/(πd²)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">L d²</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">d × 2 → R ÷ 4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Wire stretched n times</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">R<sub>new</sub> = n² R</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">n² —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">stretched to 2L → R × 4 (volume same)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Power P (same R)</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">P = I²R</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">I², R —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">I × 2 → P × 4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Power P (same V)</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">P = V²/R</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">V² R</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">V × 2 → P × 4 · R ÷ 2 → P × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Energy E</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">E = P t</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">P, t —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">t × 2 → E × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Heat H</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">H = I²R t</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">I², R, t —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">I × 2 → H × 4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Charge Q</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Q = I t</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">I, t —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">t × 2 → Q × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Current density J</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">J = I/A</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">I A</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">A × 2 → J ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Conductance G</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">G = 1/R</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">— R</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">R × 2 → G ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">n equal R in parallel</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">R<sub>p</sub> = R/n</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">R n</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">n × 2 → R<sub>p</sub> ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Max power transfer</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">P<sub>max</sub> = V<sub>th</sub>²/4R<sub>th</sub></td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">V<sub>th</sub>² R<sub>th</sub></td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">V<sub>th</sub> × 2 → P<sub>max</sub> × 4</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"rb\" style=\"background:#f6f9f6;border-color:#2e7d32\"><div class=\"rb dk nb\" style=\"background:#2e7d32\"><p style=\"color:#fff;background:#2e7d32;padding:0 .3em;border-radius:4px;font-size:1.19em;font-weight:700;background:#2e7d32;padding:.25em .5em;border-radius:5px\">Capacitors, inductors &amp; AC</p></div><p style=\"color:#fff;background:#1b2a4a;padding:0 .3em;border-radius:4px;font-weight:700;background:#1b2a4a;padding:.25em .5em;border-radius:5px\">falls with (∝</p><div class=\"rtw\"><table class=\"rt rc\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">Quantity</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">Formula</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">rises with (∝) 1/)</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">if this changes → result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Capacitance C</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">C = ε₀ε<sub>r</sub> A/d</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">A, ε<sub>r</sub> gap d</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">d ÷ 2 → C × 2 · A × 2 → C × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Charge on C</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Q = CV</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">C, V —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">V × 2 → Q × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Energy in C</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">W = ½CV²</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">C, V² —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">V × 2 → W × 4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Inductance L</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">L = μN²A/l</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">N², μ, A length l</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">N × 2 → L × 4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Energy in L</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">W = ½LI²</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">L, I² —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">I × 2 → W × 4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Time constant RC</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">τ = RC</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">R, C —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">C × 2 → τ × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Time constant RL</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">τ = L/R</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">L R</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">R × 2 → τ ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Inductive reactance</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">X<sub>L</sub> = 2πfL</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">f, L —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">f × 2 → X<sub>L</sub> × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Capacitive reactance</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">X<sub>C</sub> = 1/(2πfC)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">— f, C</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">f × 2 → X<sub>C</sub> ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Resonant frequency</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">f<sub>r</sub> = 1/(2π√LC)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">— √L, √C</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">L × 4 → f<sub>r</sub> ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Q factor (series)</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Q = ωL/R</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">L, f R</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">R × 2 → Q ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Bandwidth (series)</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">BW = R/(2πL) = f<sub>r</sub>/Q</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">R L, Q</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">Q × 2 → BW ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Period / wavelength</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">T = 1/f · λ = v/f</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">v f</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">f × 2 → T ÷ 2, λ ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Skin depth</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">δ ∝ 1/√(fμσ)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">— √f</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">f × 4 → δ ÷ 2</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>",[]],"1397":["<h4 style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-size:1.75em;font-weight:700\">DIRECT &amp; INVERSE PROPORTION — 3. ELECTRIC &amp;</h4><h4 style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-size:1.75em;font-weight:700\">MAGNETIC FIELDS · ELECTRICAL MACHINES</h4><p style=\"color:#d32f2f;font-size:1.15em;font-weight:700\">GREEN = GOES UP WITH · RED = GOES DOWN WITH · LAST COLUMN = READY ANSWER</p><div class=\"rb\" style=\"background:#f8f5fa;border-color:#6a1b9a\"><div class=\"rb dk nb\" style=\"background:#6a1b9a\"><p style=\"color:#fff;background:#6a1b9a;padding:0 .3em;border-radius:4px;font-size:1.19em;font-weight:700;background:#6a1b9a;padding:.25em .5em;border-radius:5px\">Electric &amp; magnetic fields</p></div><p style=\"color:#fff;background:#1b2a4a;padding:0 .3em;border-radius:4px;font-weight:700;background:#1b2a4a;padding:.25em .5em;border-radius:5px\">falls with (∝</p><div class=\"rtw\"><table class=\"rt rc\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">Quantity</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">Formula</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">rises with (∝) 1/)</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">if this changes → result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Coulomb force</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">F = q₁q₂/(4πεr²)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">q₁, q₂ r², ε</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">r × 2 → F ÷ 4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Field of point charge</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">E = q/(4πεr²)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">q r²</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">r × 2 → E ÷ 4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Potential of point charge</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">V = q/(4πεr)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">q r</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">r × 2 → V ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Field between plates</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">E = V/d</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">V d</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">d × 2 → E ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">B near a long wire</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">B = μ₀I/(2πr)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">I r</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">r × 2 → B ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">B in a solenoid</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">B = μ₀NI/l</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">N, I length l</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">N × 2 → B × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Force on conductor</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">F = BIL sin θ</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">B, I, L —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">I × 2 → F × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Force between 2 wires</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">F/L = μ₀I₁I₂/(2πd)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">I₁, I₂ d</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">both I × 2 → F × 4</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Induced emf</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">e = N dφ/dt = BLv</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">N, rate of time taken change, v</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">speed × 2 → e × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">EMF vs frequency</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">E = 4.44 f N φ</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">f, N, φ —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">same φ: 50 → 60 Hz → E × 1.2 (200 → 240 V)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Hysteresis loss</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">1.6 P<sub>h</sub> ∝ f B<sub>m</sub></td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">1.6 f, B<sub>m</sub> —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">f × 2 → P<sub>h</sub> × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Eddy current loss</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">P<sub>e</sub> ∝ f² B<sub>m</sub> ² t²</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">f², B<sub>m</sub> ², t² —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">f × 2 → P<sub>e</sub>