esult\">C × 2 → ripple ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Chopper output</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">V<sub>o</sub> = D × V<sub>s</sub></td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">D, V<sub>s</sub> —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">D 0.25 → 0.5 → V<sub>o</sub> × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Controlled rectifier</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">V<sub>dc</sub> ∝ cos α</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">cos α —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">α 0° → 60° → V<sub>dc</sub> ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">ADC step size</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Δ = V<sub>FS</sub>/2ⁿ</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">V<sub>FS</sub> 2ⁿ</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">one more bit → step ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">PMMC / MI meter</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">θ ∝ I / θ ∝ I²</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">I / I² —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">PMMC uniform scale; MI cramped</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Ammeter shunt</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">R<sub>sh</sub> = R<sub>m</sub>/(m − 1)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">R<sub>m</sub> m − 1</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">bigger range → smaller shunt</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Antenna length</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">l ∝ λ = c/f</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">λ f</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">f × 2 → antenna ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Free-space path loss</td><td data-h=\