₁, m₂ r²</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">r × 3 → F ÷ 9</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Boyle&#x27;s law</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">PV = constant</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">— V</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">V ÷ 2 → P × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Charles&#x27; law</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">V ∝ T (kelvin)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">T —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">T × 2 → V × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Speed, time, distance</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">d = v t</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#c62828;font-weight:700\">t ∝ 1/v d ∝ t (same v) (same d)</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">speed × 2 → time ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Time and work</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">men × days = constant</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#c62828;font-weight:700\">time ∝ — 1/men</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">men × 2 → days ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Simple interest</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">SI = PRT/100</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">P, R, T —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">T × 2 → SI × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Radiated energy (black body)</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">E = σT⁴ (Stefan–Boltzmann)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">T⁴ —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">T × 2 → E × 16 (TNPSC 2025 Q123)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"rb\" style=\"background:#f6f7f7;border-color:#37474f\"><div class=\"rb dk nb\" style=\"background:#37474f\"><p style=\"color:#fff;background:#37474f;padding:0 .3em;border-radius:4px;font-size:1.19em;font-weight:700;background:#37474f;padding:.25em .5em;border-radius:5px\">Control systems &amp; signals</p></div><p style=\"color:#fff;background:#1b2a4a;padding:0 .3em;border-radius:4px;font-weight:700;background:#1b2a4a;padding:.25em .5em;border-radius:5px\">falls with (∝</p><div class=\"rtw\"><table class=\"rt rc\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">Quantity</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">Formula</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">rises with (∝) 1/)</th><th style=\"background:#1b2a4a\">if this changes → result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Peak time</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">t<sub>p</sub> = π/ω<sub>d</sub></td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#c62828;font-weight:700\">ω<sub>d</sub> — (imaginary part of pole)</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">ω<sub>d</sub> × 2 → t<sub>p</sub> ÷ 2 (ESE 2026 Q31)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Settling time (2 %)</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">t<sub>s</sub> = 4/(ζω<sub>n</sub>)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#c62828;font-weight:700\">ζω<sub>n</sub> (real — part of pole)</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">real part × 2 → t<sub>s</sub> ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Peak overshoot</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">M<sub>p</sub> = e<sup>−πζ/√(1−ζ²</sup>)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">— ζ only</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">ω<sub>n</sub> does not change M<sub>p</sub></td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Natural frequency</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">ω<sub>n</sub> = √K (s² + as + K)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">√K —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">K × 4 → ω<sub>n</sub> × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Damping ratio</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">ζ = a/(2√K)</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">a √K</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">K × 4 → ζ ÷ 2, more overshoot</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Ramp error</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">e<sub>ss</sub> = 1/K<sub>v</sub></td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">— K<sub>v</sub></td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">K × 2 → e<sub>ss</sub> ÷ 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">First-order rise time</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">t<sub>r</sub> = 2.2T</td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">T —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">T × 2 → t<sub>r</sub> × 2</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#1a3a8f;font-weight:700\">Sampling rate needed</td><td data-h=\"Formula\" style=\"font-weight:700\">f<sub>s</sub> ≥ 2f<sub>max</sub></td><td data-h=\"rises with (∝) 1/)\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:700\">f<sub>max</sub> —</td><td data-h=\"if this changes → result\">f<sub>max</sub> × 2 → f<sub>s</sub> × 2</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>",[]]}